{"title":"Project Engineer Roadmap","role":"Project Engineer","summary":"A Project Engineer in electrical engineering combines technical engineering, project planning, procurement, site execution, testing, documentation, safety and stakeholder coordination. The role can exist across power, infrastructure, manufacturing, construction, industrial automation, renewable energy and electrical systems.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1","Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. (Bachelor of Technology / Engineering)","Timeline assumption":"Four-year B.Tech/B.E. beginning in 2026 and graduating around 2030."},"about":[{"label":"Career-route check","text":"Project Engineer is a directly aligned career for Electrical Engineering, although employers may use titles such as Electrical Project Engineer, Site Engineer, Project Engineer or Project Coordinator."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[{"period":"2026–2030","question":"What can I enter now?","output":"Build electrical fundamentals plus project execution, estimation, CAD, safety and documentation skills."},{"period":"2030–2035","question":"How should I specialise?","output":"Develop expertise in electrical construction, power projects, industrial projects, EPC, renewable energy or automation."},{"period":"2035–2040","question":"How should I evolve?","output":"Take ownership of budgets, schedules, contractors, procurement, quality and multidisciplinary project delivery."},{"period":"2040–2046","question":"How can I remain relevant?","output":"Progress toward Project Manager, Engineering Manager or technical project leadership while maintaining electrical expertise."}],"sections":[{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Circuit theory, mathematics, physics and basic electrical engineering"},{"text":"NPTEL","url":"https://nptel.ac.in/"},{"text":"Complete circuit and electrical laboratory records"},{"text":"Analytical thinking"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"Electrical machines, measurements and basic electronics"},{"text":"NPTEL","url":"https://nptel.ac.in/"},{"text":"Machine/measurement project"},{"text":"Technical foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"Power systems, electrical installations and engineering drawing"},{"text":"NPTEL","url":"https://nptel.ac.in/"},{"text":"Prepare a small electrical installation design"},{"text":"Technical execution"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"AutoCAD, estimation, BOQ and electrical equipment selection"},{"text":"Autodesk Learning","url":"https://www.autodesk.com/learn"},{"text":"Electrical drawing + bill of quantities"},{"text":"Execution, digital literacy"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"Project planning, scheduling, procurement and contracts"},{"text":"PMI","url":"https://www.pmi.org/"},{"text":"Create a WBS, schedule, risk register and procurement plan"},{"text":"Strategic thinking"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"Industrial electrical systems, safety, QA/QC and site execution"},{"text":"OSHA Electrical Safety","url":"https://www.osha.gov/electrical"},{"text":"Site/project simulation with inspection checklist"},{"text":"Ownership"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 1"},{"text":"Power/industrial project design and cost estimation"},{"text":"IEEE","url":"https://www.ieee.org/"},{"text":"Complete electrical design + cost estimate"},{"text":"Analytical thinking"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 2"},{"text":"Major project + industry internship/site exposure"},{"text":"POWERGRID · Larsen & Toubro","url":"https://www.powergrid.in/"},{"text":"Complete project dossier, drawings, schedule and presentation"},{"text":"Leadership, communication"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Core technical subjects to master"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Electrical circuits"},{"text":"Electrical machines"},{"text":"Power systems"},{"text":"Electrical measurements"},{"text":"Power electronics"},{"text":"Electrical installations"},{"text":"Switchgear and protection"},{"text":"Control systems"},{"text":"Industrial electrical systems"},{"text":"Electrical safety"},{"text":"AutoCAD/electrical CAD"},{"text":"Estimation and costing"},{"text":"Project planning"},{"text":"Procurement and contracts"},{"text":"Quality assurance and quality control"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Four-year honours variant"},{"type":"p","text":"Use the additional year for industry experience, advanced project management, renewable-energy projects, electrical design or a multidisciplinary engineering project."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation"},{"type":"table","header":["Lane","Core stack","Learn from","Senior role it leads to"],"rows":[[{"text":"Electrical EPC"},{"text":"Electrical design, BOQ, procurement, site execution"},{"text":"Larsen & Toubro","url":"https://www.larsentoubro.com/"},{"text":"Senior Electrical Project Engineer"}],[{"text":"Power Projects"},{"text":"Substations, transmission, protection, commissioning"},{"text":"POWERGRID","url":"https://www.powergrid.in/"},{"text":"Power Project Lead"}],[{"text":"Industrial Projects"},{"text":"Motors, MCCs, VFDs, industrial distribution"},{"text":"Siemens","url":"https://www.siemens.com/"},{"text":"Industrial Project Manager"}],[{"text":"Renewable Energy"},{"text":"Solar/wind, grid connection, electrical design"},{"text":"NREL","url":"https://www.nrel.gov/"},{"text":"Renewable Energy Project Engineer"}],[{"text":"Automation"},{"text":"PLC, SCADA, instrumentation and control"},{"text":"Siemens Automation","url":"https://www.siemens.com/global/en/products/automation.html"},{"text":"Automation Project Engineer"}],[{"text":"Construction/Infrastructure"},{"text":"Electrical services, MEP coordination, site management"},{"text":"Autodesk","url":"https://www.autodesk.com/"},{"text":"Electrical Project Manager"}]]},{"type":"note","label":"Evolve and stay relevant, 2035–2046","text":"Project engineering increasingly requires both technical knowledge and the ability to manage schedule, cost, procurement, contractors, safety, quality and digital project information. Develop strong project-management skills without losing electrical-engineering depth."}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Government / PSU routes"},{"type":"table","header":["Organisation","Relevant exposure","Link"],"rows":[[{"text":"POWERGRID"},{"text":"Transmission, substations and electrical infrastructure"},{"text":"POWERGRID Careers","url":"https://www.powergrid.in/"}],[{"text":"NTPC"},{"text":"Power generation and electrical projects"},{"text":"NTPC","url":"https://www.ntpc.co.in/"}],[{"text":"NHPC"},{"text":"Hydropower and electrical infrastructure"},{"text":"NHPC","url":"https://www.nhpcindia.com/"}],[{"text":"PGCIL/POWERGRID training"},{"text":"Transmission and substation exposure"},{"text":"POWERGRID","url":"https://www.powergrid.in/"}],[{"text":"ISRO"},{"text":"Electrical engineering projects where available"},{"text":"ISRO","url":"https://www.isro.gov.in/"}],[{"text":"DRDO"},{"text":"Electrical/electronics engineering projects where available"},{"text":"DRDO","url":"https://www.drdo.gov.in/"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Private"},{"type":"p","text":"Look for internships in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Electrical EPC"},{"text":"Power transmission/distribution"},{"text":"Solar and renewable-energy EPC"},{"text":"Industrial automation"},{"text":"Manufacturing plants"},{"text":"Electrical design consultancies"},{"text":"Construction/MEP companies"},{"text":"Infrastructure projects"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Relevant employers include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Larsen & Toubro","url":"https://www.larsentoubro.com/"},{"text":"Siemens","url":"https://www.siemens.com/"},{"text":"Schneider Electric","url":"https://www.se.com/"},{"text":"Hitachi Energy","url":"https://www.hitachienergy.com/"},{"text":"GE Vernova","url":"https://www.gevernova.com/"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Best internship evidence","text":"involvement in drawings, BOQ/e